<LegalLayout title="About idoconverter" draft={false}>
  <p>idoconverter makes small, focused tools for real everyday work: for developers, online sellers, job seekers and people filling in applications, with tools for accountants and frontend developers planned.</p>

  <h2>Your data never leaves your device</h2>
  <p>Most online converters upload your files to a server, add daily limits or ask you to sign up. Every idoconverter tool runs in your browser instead. Nothing you paste or choose is uploaded, so there is nothing for us to store, leak or sell. There are no accounts and no limits.</p>

  <h2>Made to fit the task</h2>
  <p>Instead of one generic converter, each tool does one job for one kind of work: masking personal data in JSON before sharing it, turning psql output into JSON, working out a notice period buyout, or sizing a passport photo to official rules. Formulas are shown on the page, and rule-based tools show their official source and the date we last checked it.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Have a tool idea or found a problem? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
